      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Salaan, iyo ka Digidda Cilmiga Beenta ah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anigoo Bawlos ah oo rasuulkii Ciise Masiix ku ah amarka Ilaaha Badbaadiyeheenna ah iyo Ciise Masiix oo rajadeenna ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waxaan warqaddan u qorayaa Timoteyos oo xagga iimaanka ku ah wiilkayga runta ah. Nimco iyo naxariis iyo nabadu ha kaaga yimaadeen Ilaaha Aabbaha ah iyo Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaan kugu waaniyey markaan Makedoniya tegayay ayaan haatanna kugu waaninayaa inaad Efesos sii joogtid oo aad kuwo ku amartid inayan cilmi kale dadka barin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ayan dhegaysanin sheekooyin iyo abtirsiinyada aan dhammaadka lahayn oo keena su'aalo intay hor marin lahaayeen talada Ilaah oo rumaysadka ku jirta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin amarka dhammaadkiisu waa jacayl ka soo baxa qalbi daahir ah iyo niyo wanaagsan iyo rumaysad aan labaweji lahayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxyaalahan qaar baa seegay, oo waxay ku leexdeen hadal aan micne lahayn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo waxay doonayaan inay noqdaan macallimmada sharciga in kastoo ayan garanayn waxay yidhaahdaan ama waxay ku xaqiiqeeyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaynu og nahay in sharcigu wanaagsan yahay haddii loo isticmaalo si sharciga ku qumman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaynu u og nahay, sharciga looma samayn nin xaq ah, laakiin waxaa loo sameeyey sharcilaawayaasha, iyo caasiyiinta, iyo cibaadalaawayaasha, iyo dembilayaasha, iyo kuwa aan quduuska ahayn, iyo kuwa nijaasta ah, iyo kuwa aabbahood dila, iyo kuwa hooyadood dila, iyo gacankudhiiglayaasha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo kuwa sinaysta, iyo khaniisiinta, iyo kuwa dadka xada, iyo beenlowyada, iyo kuwa beenta ku dhaarta, iyo hadday jiraan wax kaleeto oo ka gees ah cilmiga runta ah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo ah sida injiilka ammaanta Ilaaha barakada leh oo laygu ammaaneeyey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bawlos Baa Ilaah Naxariistiisa u Mahad Naqay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ku mahad naqayaa kan xoogga i siiyey oo ah Rabbigeenna Ciise Masiix, waayo, wuxuu igu tiriyey mid aamin ah intuu hawshiisa ii doortay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in kastoo aan hore u ahaan jiray mid dadka caaya oo silciya, oo dhiba, laakiin waa la ii naxariistay, waayo, aqoonla'aan baan ku sameeyey, anigoo aan rumaysanayn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimcada Rabbigeenna waxay aad iyo aad ula badatay rumaysadka iyo jacaylka ku jira Ciise Masiix. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadalkanu waa run, waana mid istaahila in la wada aqbalo, in Ciise Masiix dunida u yimid inuu badbaadiyo dembilayaasha anoo ah kan ugu daran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiin sababtaas daraaddeed waa la ii naxariistay in, anigoo ah kan ugu daran, Ciise Masiix iga muujiyo dulqaadashadiisa oo dhan, inaan masaal u noqdo kuwa hadda dabadeed isaga rumaysan doona inay nolol weligeed ah helaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boqorka daa'imiska ah, oo aan dhiman karin, oo aan la arki karin, oo ah Ilaaha keligiis ah, maamuus iyo ammaanu ha u ahaadeen weligiis iyo weligiis. Aamiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wiilkaygii Timoteyosow, waxaan kugu ammaanaynayaa amarkan oo ah sidii waxyaalihii hore laguugu sheegay, inaad iyaga dagaal wanaagsan ku dagaallantid, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adigoo haysta iimaan iyo qalbi wanaagsan. Waxyaalahaas dadka qaarkood way iska tuureen, oo waxay iimaankooda ka dhigeen sida doonni burburtay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaana ka mid ah Humenayos iyo Aleksanderos, oo aan Shaydaan u dhiibay si ay u bartaan inayan wax caayin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
